<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Someone asked to change the password for <strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>. You can do it with the button below.</p>

<%= email_button "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

<p class="muted">If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email. Your password stays the same until you open the link and choose a new one.</p>
